boisedev.com/news/2026/07/07/you-asked-has-meridian-been-installing-flock-surveillance-cameras/","author":["[[Erin Banks Rusby - BoiseDev Reporter]]"],"published":"2026-07-07","created":"2026-07-22","description":"In recent months, the installation of cameras at intersections in Meridian has prompted questions about surveillance in the city. A BoiseDev reader wrote in to ask if the city was installing Flock Safety cameras. One of the company’s products is an automated license plate reader (ALPR) camera that can record license plates and other details, […]","tags":["#idaho"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},